  "chain": "operator disregarded HU tools / no pre-job brief, no procedure in hand, no peer-check [cause A] + lack of NUSO oversight -> operator closes wrong flow control valve (2-FCV-74-28 instead of 2-FCV-74-16) -> B train RHR/LHSI valve closed while A train already out for maintenance -> both trains of RHR (LHSI) inoperable for 4 minutes [no backup available; corrected by crew reopening valve]",
