  ],
  "notes": "No component failed; this is a pure personnel-error event. The A train of RHR/LHSI was already out of service for preplanned maintenance when the operator's erroneous manipulation of 2-FCV-74-28 (on the B train) rendered the B train inoperable too, resulting in both trains of Unit 2 LHSI being inoperable for 4 minutes. No backup system stated as operable during this window (RHR/LHSI itself has two trains, both affected) so no BACKED_UP_BY edge emitted. Section VII states no previous similar events, so no SIMILAR_TO/stub LER node is created. HIC modeled as a component per EIIS tag though not itself failed physically -- it was the wrong component manipulated."
